✅ Issue 11/13 fixed.

**Issue 12/13:** `TipEditor.tsx:78` — sync `inputValue` when `receiptTip` prop changes. 🟠 Major. (Same file, already read.)

**Verified — real, narrow collaborative-edit issue.**
- At lines 75-78, when the `receiptTip` prop changes, only `tip` is synced via `setTip(receiptTip)` — `inputValue` (the rendered field value, passed to `TipEditForm`) is left stale.
- Reachable when the prop changes **while already editing** (e.g. another user updates the tip via Zero real-time sync). The field then shows the old text while `tip`/save use the new value — UI/value mismatch. (Entering edit via `handleEditTip` syncs both, so the non-editing path is fine.)
- Fix is consistent with the file's existing `.toFixed(2)` formatting (lines 37, 88, 135).

Proposed change:
```diff
   if (!receiptTip.equals(prevReceiptTipRef.current)) {
     prevReceiptTipRef.current = receiptTip;
     setTip(receiptTip);
+    setInputValue(receiptTip.toFixed(2));
   }
```

